| D@80% | none (honest) | #105 | 1.000 / 1.000 / 1.000 / 1.000 / 1.000 | 1.489 % |
| D@80% | deposit 1x, withdrawn in the same second | M6 as built (#104) | 1.353 / 1.353 / 1.352 / 1.275 / 1.130 | 1.489 % |
